                "subject": "Payment Reminder – {{invoiceNumber}}",
                "bodyType": "rawHtml",
                "content": "<h2>Payment Reminder – Overdue Invoice</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Team,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is an automated payment reminder from\r\nBrightloop Subscription Management System.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Invoice Details</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><b>Invoice Number:</b> Invoice Number:</li>\r\n  <li><b>Customer:</b> customerName</li>\r\n  <li><b>Issue Date:</b> issueDate</li>\r\n  <li><b>Due Date:</b>  dueDate</li>\r\n  <li><b>Outstanding Balance:</b> ₹balanceDue</li>\r\n  <li><b>Status:</b> status</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Please review this invoice and arrange payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><i>This is a hackathon demonstration email.</i></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regards,<br>\r\nBrightloop Subscription Management System</p>\r\n  <li><b>Outstanding Balance:</b> ₹1,180</li>\r\n  <li><b>Payment Status:</b> Overdue</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This email was automatically generated through\r\nMake using invoice information retrieved from Odoo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>This is a hackathon demonstration email.\r\nNo payment is required.</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regards,<br>\r\nBrightloop Subscription Management System</p>"
            },
